Package: agent-inbox
Version: @VERSION@-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: vp916 <https://github.com/vp916>
Depends: python3, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtnetwork, python3-pyside6.qtqml, python3-pyside6.qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-org-kde-layershell, qt6-wayland, systemd
Recommends: pipewire-bin, sound-theme-freedesktop
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/vp916/agent-inbox
Description: One inbox for your coding agents
 An overlay that shows what Claude Code, Codex, Copilot, Antigravity, OpenCode
 and other coding agents are doing, and lets you answer their questions and
 permission prompts without switching windows. Needs a Wayland desktop with
 layer-shell (KDE Plasma 6, Hyprland, Sway, niri).
 .
 Run 'agent-inbox-setup install' as your user after installing.
